WEBVTT

00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:31.996
CA: This was really exciting,

00:08:32.036 --> 00:08:34.236
and it builds on a couple hundred million

00:08:34.276 --> 00:08:37.996
already committed by the founding
donors of Drive Electric,

00:08:38.036 --> 00:08:42.596
so that we're already over halfway
to your billion-dollar goal, right?

00:08:42.596 --> 00:08:44.636
So how is this? How does this feel?

00:08:44.676 --> 00:08:45.996
Where are you now?

00:08:46.636 --> 00:08:50.436
MA: It's electrifying.

00:08:50.436 --> 00:08:52.956
(Laughter)

00:08:52.956 --> 00:08:55.636
But I mean, I know
there partners are here,

00:08:55.676 --> 00:08:57.996
I can see where they are sitting,

00:08:58.036 --> 00:08:59.596
from foundations,

00:08:59.636 --> 00:09:02.076
I’m sure Anthony’s somewhere here.